x.q('policy_role_and_presentation_conservation',0,76,100,'instruction_assembly','Role/context policy remains identified data through owners. Tuning preserves prior exact supplied policy/context and cannot implicitly alter authority,requirements,acceptance,topology or Worker/Evaluator/Consequence ownership. Tools/validators do not assume semantic judgment. Instructions/input/question/rubric/output agree on role; independent assessor receives exact candidate and is not reassigned authorship. Shared material preserves order,source,version,qualifications,dependencies,assessment disposition and accessible required bodies; repetition needs declared presentation need, not enclosing carrier/history alone. Context correspondence,presentation fidelity,semantic sufficiency are distinct qualification claims; schema/identity/size cannot prove sufficiency or same stochastic judgment after presentation changes.')
