x.q('direct_program_authority',3,19,51,'direct_hog_execution','Load admitted GTL without flattened executable representation. Public execution binds exact Product,required workspace,catalog view,program,callable membership,I/O contracts,invocation authority, not names/package presence/defaults. GraphFunction materializes replayable template under declared inputs/structural parameters; template and graph authorize direct HoG graph/C traversal, not implementation-only callable. Complete TS/GTL validation before entry; invalid/unresolved law fails or remains typed pressure before prohibited effects. Reject generated HoG programs,CompiledCProgramPlan,compiled declarations/runtime catalogs/other executable IR as authority. Vectors stay internal typed boundaries, not callable/program/plan. Recursion uses declared function relations and invocation-local call/frame, not callbacks/queues/worker topology.')
x.q('runtime_and_ingress_authority',3,53,79,'direct_hog_execution','ABG owns post-entry invocation/result/evidence/failure/consequence/judgment/correction/continuation/closure admission. Fail closed on undeclared program/function,missing membership,malformed parameters,contract mismatch,missing seam,invalid basis or unresolved law. Ingress admits typed invocation then ignites/continues, never orders One Surface/private state/retry/continuation/closure. Next locus derives GTL and replay state, not fields/memory/counters/handler order/first-vector shortcut. Execution proof must show exact admission,HoG progression,effects,ABG admission,replay outcome, not just materialization/vector dispatch/implementation/event co-presence. Missing compute basis yields no_compute_basis, never no-op/identity/F_D/F_P/F_H fallback.')
x.q('liveness_and_zoom_boundaries',3,81,100,'direct_hog_execution','Every liveness-affecting surface publishes admitted activity probe when required, observing activity/evidence only. One replay projection of admitted probes/interruption supplies liveness, not CLI timers/harness/summaries. Watchdog/evaluator consumes it for continue,inactivity,interruption/safety-cap block,retry exhaustion,salvage admission. Unless admitted lawful alternative, HoG continues graph; caller timeout is not default law. Attention/zoom uses ABG frames anchored to GTL, no rival topology/loops.')
